			"y":180,
			"width":250,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0105793a6991a3e9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"research how to import my files from here to windows\n\nedit: just create a partition for the e drive, in which the you split the drive in half; one for linux and one for windows. it should be enough because its 4.5tb",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":520,
			"y":-65,
			"width":260,
			"height":275
		},
		{
			"id":"3ce5103ea8e7bbb2",
